- 4200000000 |  4200000000.00 |  4200000000.00 |  4200000000
-   0.000012 |            .00 |            .00 |            .00
-   Infinity |    Infinity    |    Infinity    |    Infinity
-  -Infinity | -  Infinity    | -  Infinity    | -  Infinity
-        NaN |         NaN    |         NaN    |         NaN
