--- test roundoff edge case when source < origin
-SELECT date_bin('30 minutes'::interval, timestamptz '2024-02-01 15:00:00', timestamptz '2024-02-01 17:00:00');
-           date_bin           
-------------------------------
- Thu Feb 01 15:00:00 2024 PST
-(1 row)
