-------+-----------------+------------------+--------------------+------------------+----------------------+--------------------
- PT0S | P1Y2M           | P1DT2H3M4S       | PT2H3M4.45679S     | P1Y2M3DT4H5M6.7S | P1Y2M-3DT-4H-5M-6.7S | P-1Y-2M3DT4H5M6.7S
-(1 row)
