-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Update on some_tab
-   Update on some_tab_child some_tab_1
-   ->  Result
-         ->  Index Scan using some_tab_child_f1_f2_idx on some_tab_child some_tab_1
-               Index Cond: ((f1 = 12) AND (f2 = 13))
-(5 rows)
