---------------------------------------------------
- Hash Join
-   Hash Cond: (a.ten = c.ten)
-   ->  Seq Scan on onek a
-         Filter: (ten = ANY ('{1,2}'::integer[]))
-   ->  Hash
-         ->  Seq Scan on tenk1 c
-(6 rows)
-
-EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF)
-SELECT c.unique1,c.ten FROM tenk1 c JOIN onek a USING (ten)
-WHERE c.ten IN (VALUES (1), (2));
-                    QUERY PLAN                    
---------------------------------------------------
- Hash Join
-   Hash Cond: (c.ten = a.ten)
-   ->  Seq Scan on tenk1 c
-         Filter: (ten = ANY ('{1,2}'::integer[]))
-   ->  Hash
-         ->  Seq Scan on onek a
-(6 rows)
