---------------------------------------------------
- Gather
-   Workers Planned: 4
-   ->  Parallel Hash Semi Join
-         Hash Cond: (t1.fivethous = t2.fivethous)
-         ->  Parallel Seq Scan on tenk1 t1
-               Filter: (fivethous < 5)
-         ->  Parallel Hash
-               ->  Parallel Seq Scan on tenk1 t2
-(8 rows)
-
-rollback;
