-   ->  Result
-   ->  Hash Full Join
-         Hash Cond: (a1.unique1 = (1))
-         Filter: (1 = COALESCE((1), (1)))
-         ->  Seq Scan on tenk1 a1
-         ->  Hash
-               ->  Result
