-------------------------------------------
- Merge Right Join
-   Merge Cond: (b.id = d.a)
-   ->  Group
-         Group Key: b.id
-         ->  Index Scan using b_pkey on b
-   ->  Sort
-         Sort Key: d.a
-         ->  Seq Scan on d
-(8 rows)
