-   Group Key: a.a
-   Filter: EXISTS(SubPlan exists_1)
-   ->  Seq Scan on public.agg_simplify a
-         Output: a.a, a.not_null_col, a.nullable_col
-   SubPlan exists_1
-     ->  Seq Scan on public.onek b
-           Filter: (count(a.not_null_col) = b.four)
