------------------------------------------------
- Bitmap Heap Scan on spgist_domain_tbl
-   Recheck Cond: ((f1)::text = 'fo'::text)
-   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on spgist_domain_idx
-         Index Cond: ((f1)::text = 'fo'::text)
