- 1 | abc | regress_rls_bob
- 2 | bcd | regress_rls_bob
- 4 | def | regress_rls_carol
- 5 | efg | regress_rls_bob
- 6 | fgh | regress_rls_bob
- 8 | fgh | regress_rls_carol
-(6 rows)
