--- \setenv, \getenv
--- ensure MYVAR isn't set
-\setenv MYVAR
--- in which case, reading it doesn't change the target
-\getenv res MYVAR
-\echo :res
-:res
--- now set it
-\setenv MYVAR 'environment value'
-\getenv res MYVAR
-\echo :res
-environment value
