------
-   1
-(1 row)
-
- warn 
-------
- t
-(1 row)
-
- two 
------
-   2
-(1 row)
-
--- \gset applies to last query only
-SELECT 3 AS three \; SELECT warn('3.5') \; SELECT 4 AS four \gset
-NOTICE:  warn 3.5
-CONTEXT:  PL/pgSQL function warn(text) line 2 at RAISE
- three 
--------
