-------------------------------------------------------------
- Hash Join
-   Hash Cond: ((a.x = b.x) AND (a.y = b.y) AND (a.z = b.z))
-   ->  Seq Scan on sb_1 a
-   ->  Hash
-         ->  Seq Scan on sb_2 b
-(5 rows)
