-   Hash Cond: ((sb_1.x = sb_2.x) AND (sb_1.y = sb_2.y) AND (sb_1.x = sb_2.x))
-   ->  Seq Scan on sb_1
-   ->  Hash
-         ->  Seq Scan on sb_2
-(5 rows)
