- id | owner | worker | checked_by 
-----+-------+--------+------------
-  1 |     1 |        |           
-  2 |     2 |      2 |           
-  3 |     4 |      4 |          4
-(3 rows)
-
-DELETE FROM users WHERE id = 4;
