--- /home/dcalford/CliWork/ScratchBird/tests/compatibility/postgresql/repos/postgres/src/test/regress/expected/foreign_data.out	2026-02-03 15:30:02.125410473 -0500
+++ /home/dcalford/CliWork/ScratchBird/tests/compatibility/postgresql/results/ctest/20260303_201336/upstream/results/foreign_data.out	2026-03-03 20:22:12.628634830 -0500
