-   ->  Append
-         ->  Index Scan using ec1_expr2 on ec1 ec1_1
-               Index Cond: (((ff + 2) + 1) = '42'::bigint)
-         ->  Index Scan using ec1_expr3 on ec1 ec1_2
-               Index Cond: (((ff + 3) + 1) = '42'::bigint)
