-               Index Cond: (((ff + 2) + 1) = (((ec1_1.ff + 2) + 1)))
-         ->  Index Scan using ec1_expr3 on ec1 ec1_5
-               Index Cond: (((ff + 3) + 1) = (((ec1_1.ff + 2) + 1)))
