-       unspec       |      without       |     with cond      |     with uncond      |         with         
---------------------+--------------------+--------------------+----------------------+----------------------
- null               | null               | null               | [null]               | [null]
- 12.3               | 12.3               | 12.3               | [12.3]               | [12.3]
- true               | true               | true               | [true]               | [true]
- "aaa"              | "aaa"              | "aaa"              | ["aaa"]              | ["aaa"]
- [1, null, "2"]     | [1, null, "2"]     | [1, null, "2"]     | [[1, null, "2"]]     | [[1, null, "2"]]
- {"a": 1, "b": [2]} | {"a": 1, "b": [2]} | {"a": 1, "b": [2]} | [{"a": 1, "b": [2]}] | [{"a": 1, "b": [2]}]
