-----------------------+----------+----------------------+----------------------
- WS.001.1a            | 001      |                      | PS.base.a1          
- WS.001.1b            | 001      |                      | PS.base.a3          
- WS.001.2a            | 001      |                      |                     
- WS.001.2b            | 001      |                      |                     
- WS.001.3a            | 001      |                      |                     
- WS.001.3b            | 001      |                      |                     
