--- Can reference function with or without OUT params for DROP, etc
-DROP FUNCTION rngfunc(int);
-DROP FUNCTION rngfuncr(in f2 int, out f1 int, out text);
-DROP FUNCTION rngfuncb(in f1 int, inout f2 int);
