- largest surrogate                  | \x         | \xedbfbf     | invalid byte sequence for encoding "UTF8": 0xed 0xbf 0xbf
- next after surrogates              | \xee8080   |              | 
- largest 3-byte                     | \xefbfbf   |              | 
