- smallest 4-byte overlong           | \x         | \xf0808080   | invalid byte sequence for encoding "UTF8": 0xf0 0x80 0x80 0x80
- largest 4-byte overlong            | \x         | \xf08fbfbf   | invalid byte sequence for encoding "UTF8": 0xf0 0x8f 0xbf 0xbf
