-ERROR:  constraint must be added to child tables too
-HINT:  Do not specify the ONLY keyword.
-ALTER TABLE ONLY list_parted2 ADD CONSTRAINT check_b CHECK (b <> 'zz');
-ERROR:  constraint must be added to child tables too
--- dropping them is ok though
