-select (fn).first, substr((fn).last, 1, 20), length((fn).last) from people;
- first |        substr        | length  
--------+----------------------+---------
- Jack  | Blow                 |       4
- Jack  | abcdefghijklabcdefgh | 1200000
-(2 rows)
