-    UNION ALL
-    SELECT (SELECT * FROM x) FROM x WHERE id < 5
-) SELECT * FROM x;
-ERROR:  recursive reference to query "x" must not appear within a subquery
-LINE 3:     SELECT (SELECT * FROM x) FROM x WHERE id < 5
-                                  ^
--- mutual recursive query (not implemented)
