- i      | integer |           |          | 3 + 10                                | plain   |              | 
- j      | integer |           |          | 101                                   | plain   |              | 
- k      | integer |           |          | generated always as ((b + 10)) stored | plain   |              | 
-Partition of: t_bigint DEFAULT
