-                           ->  Seq Scan on alpha_pos_p2 t1_5
-                                 Filter: ((b >= 125) AND (b < 225))
-                           ->  Seq Scan on alpha_pos_p3 t1_6
-                                 Filter: ((b >= 125) AND (b < 225))
