-   ->  Seq Scan on lp_bc lp_2
-         Filter: ((a > 'a'::bpchar) AND (a <= 'd'::bpchar))
-   ->  Seq Scan on lp_default lp_3
-         Filter: ((a > 'a'::bpchar) AND (a <= 'd'::bpchar))
-(7 rows)
