---------------------------------------------------------------------
- Nested Loop Left Join
-   ->  Seq Scan on pred_tab t1
-   ->  Materialize
-         ->  Nested Loop Left Join
-               Join Filter: ((t3.b IS NULL) AND (t3.a IS NOT NULL))
-               ->  Nested Loop Left Join
-                     Join Filter: (t2.a = t3.a)
-                     ->  Seq Scan on pred_tab t2
-                     ->  Materialize
-                           ->  Seq Scan on pred_tab_notnull t3
-               ->  Materialize
-                     ->  Seq Scan on pred_tab t4
