----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Sort
-   Output: t1.x, (sum(t1.y)), (count(*))
-   Sort Key: t1.x
-   ->  Append
-         ->  Finalize HashAggregate
-               Output: t1.x, sum(t1.y), count(*)
